<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">Hi, Allison.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">I'm writing to inform=
 you that I was unexpectedly dismissed from my volunteer position at Honeym=
an State Park today, one week before my scheduled departure. I was not give=
n any paperwork or official documentation.
 I was simply told to turn over my keys and leave within 24 hours.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">I believe this dismis=
sal was not only unprofessional but retaliatory, stemming from a series of =
escalating tensions initiated after I submitted a respectful email expressi=
ng concern over a prior interaction
 with leadership. Since that moment, I=92ve experienced a breakdown in comm=
unication, exclusion, and intimidation. Today=92s action felt targeted and =
final, without process or fairness.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">Because I had already=
 committed to this volunteer program for the full year=97with parks lined u=
p nearly every month=97this sudden dismissal has placed me in a logistical =
and financial crisis. I have no current
 housing and limited funds until I begin my next assignment.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">To help provide a ful=
ler picture, I=92ve recorded a video explaining the sequence of events and =
the emotional and practical weight this situation has placed on me. I=92ve =
also included my documentation.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">You can view the vide=
o here:</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in"><a href=3D"https://yo=
utu.be/B1oe-qvjmMI">https://youtu.be/B1oe-qvjmMI</a></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">I am reaching out not=
 only to request review of how this was handled but to ask whether there is=
 any immediate support the department can offer as I transition. I believe =
I=92ve served with integrity and deep
 commitment to the mission of Oregon State Parks, and I only ask that I be =
treated with the same respect.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">Thank you for your ti=
me and attention. I am available to speak further if necessary.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">Warm regards,</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal" style=3D"margin-left:1.0in">Robert Samuel White (=
Host 40423)</p>
</div>
